### @bufbuild/re2

The linear-time regular-expression engine behind a rule's `matches()`. A port of RE2JS (itself a port of RE2J, the Java
port of Go's `regexp` package); the upstream projects are where the RE2 design and the Go Authors' work come from.

License: MIT
Copyright (c) 2023 Alexey Vasiliev

### n3

The RDF reader for Turtle, TriG and N-Quads (the RDF import, `server/src/rdf/parse.ts`), a direct dependency of the server.

