### @comunica/query-sparql-rdfjs

The SPARQL 1.1 query engine the quad source runs (`server/src/rdf/sparql-engine.ts`), a direct dependency of the server, pinned to
5.5.0. Ythril runs it over its own records only: it parses every query first and refuses SERVICE, LOAD and every update, and runs the
engine with a fetch that refuses, so none of the HTTP packages below is ever asked to fetch. It pulls in the packages below it, each
attributed here.

